{"id":"da71e16420fa5708","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-bounded-set.md","title":"Bounded Set","display":"df-bounded-set — Bounded Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bounded-set","aliases":["58-df-bounded-set","Bounded Set"],"display":"df-bounded-set — Bounded Set","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bounded-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bounded-set</span><span>Bounded Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-set — Bounded Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\)</span> (metric space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq X\">\\(A \\subseteq X\\)</span> (子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S,\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S,\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diam}_{X,d}:\\mathcal P(X)\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\operatorname{diam}_{X,d}:\\mathcal P(X)\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (diameter determined by the displayed metric)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}metric\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S(A,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(d(x,y)\\leq M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}metric\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S(A,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(d(x,y)\\leq M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}diameter} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\operatorname{diam}_{X,d}(A)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;A=\\emptyset,\\\\\\sup\\{d(x,y):x,y\\in A\\}&amp;A\\neq\\emptyset.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}diameter} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\operatorname{diam}_{X,d}(A)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;A=\\emptyset,\\\\\\sup\\{d(x,y):x,y\\in A\\}&amp;A\\neq\\emptyset.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}totally\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}metric\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S(A,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in X^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in n}\\{x\\in X:d(x,b(i))&lt;\\varepsilon\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}totally\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}metric\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S(A,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in X^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in n}\\{x\\in X:d(x,b(i))&lt;\\varepsilon\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and metric are explicit arguments of both predicates; the former notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bounded}_X(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bounded}_X(A)\\)</span> left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> unbound.</li>\n<li>Bounded: finite diameter</li>\n<li>Totally bounded: can be covered by finitely many arbitrarily small balls</li>\n<li>Precompact: closure is compact</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>: bounded iff contained in some ball</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)$ (metric space, see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S,\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{diam}_{X,d}:\\mathcal P(X)\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}metric\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S(A,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(d(x,y)\\leq M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}diameter} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\to\\operatorname{diam}_{X,d}(A)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&A=\\emptyset,\\\\\\sup\\{d(x,y):x,y\\in A\\}&A\\neq\\emptyset.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}totally\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}metric\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S(A,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in X^n\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i\\in n}\\{x\\in X:d(x,b(i))<\\varepsilon\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bounded}_X(A)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1801,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf469772e5a6dfb0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedMetric}_S$ (metric-boundedness predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-set]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-set]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-bounded-set.md|58-df-bounded-set]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97"]}